  "materials": {},
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "query-transport",
      "title": "官方 Python SDK：请求怎样进入 CLI 传输层？",
      "objectives": [
        "沿 SDK query 定位 InternalClient 与默认传输。",
        "指出 SDK 如何通过进程管道连接 CLI。",
        "区分 SDK 源码事实与二进制内部未知行为。"
      ],
      "priorKnowledge": [
        "理解异步生成器、进程 stdin/stdout 与 JSON 行协议。",
        "此教材固定 Python SDK 0.2.187，不是 Anthropic Messages API 客户端课程。"
      ],
      "prerequisiteLessons": [],
      "concepts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "官方 Agent SDK 是本章唯一 Git 来源。公开 query 默认构造 options，创建 InternalClient 并转发 process_query；不能把该客户端视为 CLI 内部 Agent Loop。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "query-entry",
            "query-delegate"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "InternalClient 支持自定义 transport；普通分支创建 SubprocessCLITransport 并 connect。默认传输负责找 CLI、构建参数和启动进程。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "transport-select",
            "cli-find",
            "cli-connect",
            "spawn"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "范围是默认传输、普通字符串 prompt、无 session_store 恢复的路径。二进制内部模型调度、工具策略和上下文算法不由 SDK 管道证明。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "client-entry",
            "transport-select",
            "spawn"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "sourceReading": [
        "query-entry",
        "query-delegate",
        "client-entry",
        "transport-select",
        "cli-find",
        "cli-args",
        "cli-input",
        "cli-connect",
        "spawn",
        "query-setup",
        "send",
        "receive"
      ],
      "keySymbols": [
        {
          "name": "query",
          "sourceRef": "query-entry"
        },
        {
          "name": "process_query",
          "sourceRef": "client-entry"
        },
        {
          "name": "_process_query_inner",
          "sourceRef": "transport-select"
        },
        {
          "name": "connect",
          "sourceRef": "cli-connect"
        }
      ],
      "execution": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "1. query 将 prompt/options/transport 传给 InternalClient.process_query。process_query 校验会话选项，再进入 _process_query_inner；退出时关闭内部生成器并清理恢复资源。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "query-delegate",
            "client-entry"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "2. _process_query_inner 选择调用者传输或 SubprocessCLITransport，再 connect。默认传输查找已捆绑或系统中的 CLI，不在 SDK 中实现 CLI 二进制内部循环。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "transport-select",
            "cli-find",
            "spawn"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "3. 参数使用 stream-json 输入输出；connect 通过 anyio.open_process 传入 stdin/stdout 管道和 cwd/env，并建立文本收发流。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "cli-args",
            "cli-input",
            "spawn"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "4. 客户端创建 Query，start 后 initialize；字符串任务封装为 user 消息，以 JSON 加换行写入传输。之后迭代 receive_messages，经 parse_message 返回。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "query-setup",
            "send",
            "receive"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "calls": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "SDK 调用链：query → InternalClient.process_query → _process_query_inner → SubprocessCLITransport.connect → anyio.open_process。消息发送由客户端在初始化后调用 transport.write。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "query-delegate",
            "client-entry",
            "transport-select",
            "spawn",
            "send"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "scenario": "教学场景：应用调用 SDK query(prompt=\"解释订单状态\")，不传自定义 transport，不启用会话恢复。只用固定源码追踪选项、子进程和 user JSON 的构造，不启动 Claude、不使用密钥。",
      "designRationale": [
        {
          "kind": "inference",
          "text": "传输接口使客户端与具体进程载体分离，这是从选择分支推断的设计作用；自定义传输的实际语义需独立核对。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "transport-select"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "在自己的 Harness 里可先画清“客户端协议”和“运行时实现”边界，再评估是否需要进程隔离；启动进程本身不等于已经提供安全沙箱。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "spawn",
            "send"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "faq": [
        {
          "question": "_internal 目录是否代表掌握了 Claude Code 内部运行时？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "text": "不是。这里是公开 Python SDK 的私有模块命名；源码显示它连接传输并处理协议，CLI 二进制作为外部进程启动。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "transport-select",
              "spawn"
            ],
            "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
          }
        },
        {
          "question": "官方 SDK 与公开仓库能共用同一个 Git SHA 吗？",
          "answer": {
            "kind": "advice",
            "text": "不能。本课程固定 SDK 自己的仓库和提交；公开 Hook 课程有独立版次。引用必须回到当前仓库的对象。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "query-entry",
              "spawn"
            ],
            "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
          }
        }
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "transport-boundary",
          "kind": "single-choice",
          "prompt": "默认 SDK 传输在公开代码中怎样连接 Claude CLI？",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "process",
              "text": "通过 anyio.open_process 启动进程并建立管道"
            },
            {
              "id": "loop",
              "text": "在 Python 中直接调用 CLI 内部模型调度函数"
            }
          ],
          "correctOption": "process",
          "explanation": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "text": "默认 SubprocessCLITransport.connect 以 stdin/stdout 管道启动 CLI；此调用点不提供二进制内部函数链。",
            "sourceRefs": [
              "spawn",
              "transport-select"
            ],
            "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
          }
        }
      ],
      "summary": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "query 委托客户端，默认传输启动 CLI；初始化后用 JSON 行协议发送用户消息，返回流由 Query 与解析器消费。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "query-delegate",
            "transport-select",
            "spawn",
            "send",
            "receive"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "messages-control",
      "title": "消息与控制回调怎样分流并返回？",
      "objectives": [
        "区分普通 SDK 消息、control_response 与 control_request。",
        "沿 NDJSON 读取、Query 路由、receive_messages 和 parse_message 回到调用者。",
        "说明回调处理证明什么、没有证明什么。"
      ],
      "priorKnowledge": [
        "已理解默认 SDK 请求与子进程边界。",
        "了解异步迭代和请求 ID 关联。"
      ],
      "prerequisiteLessons": [
        "query-transport"
      ],
      "concepts": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "默认传输从 stdout 分帧读取 NDJSON，限制消息长度并解析字典。Query._read_messages 再按 type 路由控制响应和控制请求。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "read",
            "route"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "control_response 按 request_id 唤醒挂起请求；control_request 交给处理器。hook_callback 查找注册回调并等待结果，can_use_tool 是另一分支。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "route",
            "control-hooks",
            "control-permission"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "普通消息从 receive_messages 输出，客户端再调用 parse_message；关闭路径位于 finally。这是 SDK 侧协议行为，不是服务端工具调度源码。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "receive-messages",
            "receive",
            "parse"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "sourceReading": [
        "read",
        "route",
        "control-permission",
        "control-hooks",
        "control-write",
        "receive-messages",
        "parse",
        "receive"
      ],
      "keySymbols": [
        {
          "name": "read_messages",
          "sourceRef": "read"
        },
        {
          "name": "_read_messages",
          "sourceRef": "route"
        },
        {
          "name": "receive_messages",
          "sourceRef": "receive-messages"
        },
        {
          "name": "parse_message",
          "sourceRef": "parse"
        }
      ],
      "execution": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "1. read_messages 委托 _read_messages_impl，从 stdout 文本块分帧、检查长度、解析行，再 yield 消息字典。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "read"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "2. Query 读取 transport 消息；控制响应通过 request_id 关联，控制请求启动处理器，二者均不当普通消息直接返回。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "route"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "3. hook_callback 分支查 callback_id 并执行已登记 callback，转换 Python 字段；缺少回调会产生异常。权限回调由 can_use_tool 分支单独处理。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "control-hooks",
            "control-permission"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "4. receive_messages 处理 end/error 哨兵，否则 yield；客户端调用 parse_message，过滤 None 并交回 query 的异步迭代调用者，finally 关闭 Query。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "receive-messages",
            "parse",
            "receive",
            "query-delegate"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "calls": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "结果链：transport.read_messages → Query._read_messages → receive_messages → InternalClient 的 parse_message → query 的调用者。控制请求在 _handle_control_request 的分支处理，不能混作 assistant 消息。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "read",
            "route",
            "receive-messages",
            "receive",
            "query-delegate",
            "control-hooks"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "scenario": "教学推演：CLI 输出包含一个控制响应、一条 hook_callback 请求和一条普通消息。先按源码标出谁处理控制消息，再找到哪条消息能到达调用者。只进行阅读追踪，不执行 CLI、Hook 或网络模型。",
      "designRationale": [
        {
          "kind": "inference",
          "text": "按类型与请求 ID 分流，有助于将控制协议与消息迭代分开；这是从路由结构推断的作用，不保证所有内部执行一定按某种顺序发生。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "route",
            "receive-messages"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        },
        {
          "kind": "advice",
          "text": "独立实现协议时可为数据流和控制流分别定义类型及关联 ID，并测试未知消息和关闭路径；不要据回调存在就宣称实现了完整权限系统。",
          "sourceRefs": [
            "route",
            "control-permission",
            "receive"
          ],
          "sourceCategory": "sdk-repo"
        }
      ],
      "faq": [
        {
